    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "inverse-definition",
        "moduleId": "inverse-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "逆变换是什么",
        "markdown": "逆变换的作用是撤销原变换：若矩阵 $\\mathbf{M}$ 把点 $\\mathbf{P}$ 映射为 $\\mathbf{P}'$，那么逆矩阵 $\\mathbf{M}^{-1}$ 应把 $\\mathbf{P}'$ 送回 $\\mathbf{P}$。教材对平移、旋转和缩放分别给出了逆矩阵，并用“与原矩阵相乘等于单位矩阵”来确认逆变换成立。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000228"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "逆变换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5976,
              "lineEnd": 6001,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1606317a69891c67562b6509b17c8747cc0225d850ef6961e469e24b69047ae5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "inverse-identity-reason",
        "moduleId": "inverse-concept",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么用单位矩阵判定逆变换",
        "markdown": "对任意点都成立 $\\mathbf{M}^{-1}(\\mathbf{M}\\mathbf{P})=\\mathbf{P}$，等价于矩阵乘积 $\\mathbf{M}^{-1}\\mathbf{M}=\\mathbf{I}$。因此判断一个矩阵是不是逆矩阵，最直接的方法是做乘法并检查结果是否为单位矩阵：主对角线为 1、其余元素为 0。这比逐点试验更完整，因为它一次覆盖了所有点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "inverse-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "translation-inverse-matrix",
        "moduleId": "translation-inverse",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "平移的逆矩阵",
        "markdown": "平移距离取负即可得到逆矩阵。若二维平移距离为 $(t_x, t_y)$，则\n\n$$\\mathbf{T}^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & -t_x \\\\ 0 & 1 & -t_y \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n它产生方向相反的平移，而平移矩阵与其逆矩阵的乘积为单位矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000228"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "逆变换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5976,
              "lineEnd": 6001,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1606317a69891c67562b6509b17c8747cc0225d850ef6961e469e24b69047ae5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "translation-inverse-example",
        "moduleId": "translation-inverse",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "算例：平移后再逆平移",
        "markdown": "设 $\\mathbf{T}(3,-2)$ 把点 $\\mathbf{P}=(1,4)$ 移到 $(4,2)$。应用逆矩阵 $\\mathbf{T}^{-1}=\\mathbf{T}(-3,2)$ 后，$(4,2)$ 回到 $(1,4)$，坐标分量恰好各减去原来的平移量。把两个平移矩阵相乘，非对角线上的 $t_x-t_x$ 与 $t_y-t_y$ 都归零，只剩单位矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "translation-inverse-matrix"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "rotation-inverse-matrix",
        "moduleId": "rotation-inverse",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "旋转的逆矩阵",
        "markdown": "逆旋转用负角替换原旋转角。绕原点旋转 $\\theta$ 的逆矩阵为\n\n$$\\mathbf{R}^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} \\cos\\theta & \\sin\\theta & 0 \\\\ -\\sin\\theta & \\cos\\theta & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n负角生成顺时针方向的旋转，与原旋转矩阵相乘得到单位矩阵。由于角度变号只影响 $\\sin$，该逆矩阵也可以通过交换行与列得到，即 $\\mathbf{R}^{-1} = \\mathbf{R}^{\\top}$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000228"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "逆变换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5976,
              "lineEnd": 6001,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1606317a69891c67562b6509b17c8747cc0225d850ef6961e469e24b69047ae5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "rotation-transpose-reason",
        "moduleId": "rotation-inverse",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么旋转的逆等于转置",
        "markdown": "把 $\\theta$ 换成 $-\\theta$ 时，$\\cos(-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta$ 保持不变，而 $\\sin(-\\theta)=-\\sin\\theta$ 变号，这正是把矩阵转置的效果。旋转矩阵左上方的 $2\\times 2$ 块是正交的，行向量互相垂直且长度为 1，因此转置后相当于反向旋转。需要注意，这条“逆等于转置”的捷径只适用于旋转这类正交矩阵，平移矩阵和一般缩放矩阵的转置并不等于它们的逆。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "rotation-inverse-matrix"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scaling-inverse-matrix",
        "moduleId": "scaling-inverse",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "缩放的逆矩阵",
        "markdown": "把缩放系数换成倒数即可得到逆矩阵。对以原点为中心、缩放参数为 $(s_x, s_y)$ 的二维缩放，\n\n$$\\mathbf{S}^{-1} = \\begin{bmatrix} \\frac{1}{s_x} & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{s_y} & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}$$\n\n该逆矩阵产生相反的缩放变换，因此缩放矩阵与其逆矩阵的乘积为单位矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000228"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "逆变换"
              ],
              "lineStart": 5976,
              "lineEnd": 6001,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "1606317a69891c67562b6509b17c8747cc0225d850ef6961e469e24b69047ae5"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scaling-singularity",
        "moduleId": "scaling-inverse",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "warning",
        "title": "缩放系数为零时不可逆",
        "markdown": "逆矩阵存在的前提是 $s_x$ 与 $s_y$ 都不为零。若其中一个为零，例如 $s_x=0$，公式中的 $\\frac{1}{s_x}$ 没有定义，矩阵的行列式也为零，矩阵不可逆。几何上，整个平面被压到一条线或一个点上，多个不同的原始点会落到同一位置，单凭结果无法判断点原来在哪里，因此不存在能恢复所有点的逆变换。平移矩阵和旋转矩阵不会出现这种退化。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "scaling-inverse-matrix",
            "translation-inverse-matrix",
            "rotation-inverse-matrix"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "inverse-check-exercise",
        "moduleId": "invertibility-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "检查：写出逆矩阵并判断可逆性",
        "markdown": "给定缩放 $\\mathbf{S}(0.5,4)$ 与平移 $\\mathbf{T}(3,-2)$，请完成两项检查：\n\n1. 写出各自的逆矩阵，并说明使用的是“取倒数”还是“取负值”规则。\n2. 判断 $s_x=0$ 时该缩放是否还能求逆，并用行列式或几何塌缩给出理由。\n\n最后用 $\\mathbf{M}^{-1}\\mathbf{M}=\\mathbf{I}$ 验证你写出的每个逆矩阵。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "translation-inverse-matrix",
            "scaling-inverse-matrix",
            "scaling-singularity"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
